{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02872","headline":"雨後 · 李百药","name":"雨後","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"晚来风景丽，晴初物色华。\n薄云向空尽，轻虹逐望斜。\n後窗临岸竹，前阶枕浦沙。\n寂寥无与晤，尊酒论风花。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李百药","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_02872.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02872","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}